{
  "bridge_text": "那棵古老的树在风中摇曳，仿佛理解了我们刚才交流的秘密。月光洒在霜冻的草地上，指引着莉娜继续她那场大胆的冒险。",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "莉娜站在树下，听着那低沉的嗡嗡声，像是在呼唤着她。她深吸一口气，拨开垂下的树枝，迈步走进了那漆黑的树洞。里面竟然藏着旋转向下的阶梯，台阶上坐着一只穿着绿色补丁背心的老灰狐狸，名字叫莫斯克。他用如同枯叶摩擦般的声音告诉莉娜，这棵树不是用来探险的，让她赶紧回家，把那阵嗡嗡声忘掉。可莉娜却倔强地摇摇头，说既然还没听过那些秘密，她怎么能轻易忘记呢？"
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s1"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "The fox’s grumpy heart hides a story all its own, one that waits just a few steps further down the wood. With the apple held tight, Lina prepared to see what lay beneath the roots.",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Lina stood firm, her eyes bright with curiosity despite his stern warning. Mosk sighed, a sound like autumn wind, and looked down at the dark, winding path. He knew he could not chase her away as easily as he had hoped."
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Mosk pointed at the door, but Lina reached into her pocket and pulled out the last apple of the season. She set it on the step between them, offering a peace gift for the trouble of her visit. Mosk stared at the apple for a long time, his sharp eyes softening just a flicker. Then he stood up, adjusted his vest, and stepped onto the first stair without a word, signaling for her to follow."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s2"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "With Mosk’s name tucked safely in your mind, we see him standing there, still guarding the threshold of his hidden world. Lina has one more move to make before the path forward clears.",
  "resume_strategy": "skip",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
