      "text": "Mosk pointed at the door, his eyes narrow and firm. Lina reached into her pocket and pulled out the last apple of the season. She set it on the step between them and whispered that this was for the trouble of walking her down. Mosk stared at the apple for a long time, then stood up, tied his vest, and stepped onto the first stair without a word."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s3"
