      "text": "Mosk pointed at the door, his eyes narrowing. Lina reached into her pocket and pulled out the last apple of the season. She set it on the step between them and said, this is for the trouble of walking me down. Mosk stared at the apple for a long time, his whiskers twitching. Then he stood up, tied his vest, and stepped onto the first stair without a word."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s2"
